  "actual_published_interface": "theorem roughCount_uniform_buchstab_fixed (M : \u2115) (hM : 2 \u2264 M) {u\u2080 : \u211d} (hu\u2080 : 1 < u\u2080)\n    {\u03b5 : \u211d} (h\u03b5 : 0 < \u03b5) :\n    \u2203 X : \u211d, 1 < X \u2227 \u2200 x \u2265 X, \u2200 u \u2208 Set.Icc u\u2080 (M : \u211d),\n      0 < u * buchstab u * x / Real.log x \u2227\n      |(roughCount x (x ^ (1 / u)) : \u211d) /\n        (u * buchstab u * x / Real.log x) - 1| < \u03b5",
